### ============================================
### REQUEST SERVICE - Pruebas de endpoints (vía API Gateway)
### Puerto interno: 3007 | Prefijo gateway: /api/v1/solicitudes -> /api/v1/requests
### Base de datos: uajs_requests (requests, request_types, request_categories,
### request_statuses, request_comments, request_attachments, request_audit_trail)
### Adjuntos: requiere un archivo previo en storage-service.http (fileId).
### ============================================

@gateway = http://localhost:3000
@direct = http://localhost:3007
@contentType = application/json
@adminEmail = evidencia.qa@uajs.edu
@adminPassword = EvidenciaQA.2026
@fileId = 1

### ============================================
### PREREQUISITOS
### 1) SUPERADMIN asignado (ver user-service.http) y LOGIN ejecutado.
### 2) Estados semilla: pending, in_review, approved, rejected, closed.
### ============================================

### HEALTH CHECK
GET {{direct}}/api/v1/requests/health

### LOGIN
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### ============================================
### CATEGORÍAS  (request_categories)
### ============================================

### Crear categoría -> 201
# @name createCategoria
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "QA_CAT",
  "name": "Categoría QA",
  "icon": "flask",
  "sortOrder": 9
}

### Listar categorías -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/categorias?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Actualizar categoría -> 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/categorias/{{createCategoria.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Categoría QA actualizada"
}

### ============================================
### TIPOS DE SOLICITUD  (request_types, con SLA y form_schema)
### ============================================

### Crear tipo -> 201
# @name createTipo
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/tipos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "categoryId": {{createCategoria.response.body.data.id}},
  "code": "QA_TIPO",
  "name": "Tipo QA",
  "description": "Tipo de solicitud para pruebas",
  "requiresApproval": true,
  "slaDays": 5,
  "cost": 0,
  "formSchema": {
    "fields": [
      { "name": "motivo", "type": "text", "required": true }
    ]
  }
}

### Listar tipos de la categoría -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/tipos?categoryId={{createCategoria.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Actualizar SLA -> 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/tipos/{{createTipo.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "slaDays": 7
}

### ============================================
### ESTADOS  (request_statuses, semilla)
### ============================================

GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/estados?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### SOLICITUDES  (requests)
### Flujo: pending -> in_review -> approved | rejected -> closed
### ============================================

### Crear solicitud (pending, ticket REQ-AAAA-NNNNNN) -> 201
# @name createSolicitud
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "requestTypeId": {{createTipo.response.body.data.id}},
  "title": "Solicitud de prueba QA2",
  "description": "Descripción detallada de la solicitud de prueba",
  "formData": {
    "motivo": "Prueba de flujo"
  }
}

### Título demasiado corto -> 400 (min 3)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "requestTypeId": {{createTipo.response.body.data.id}},
  "title": "ab",
  "description": "Descripción válida"
}

### Listar solicitudes (filtros statusId, assigneeUuid) -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes?page=1&limit=10&statusId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Obtener solicitud -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Pasar a revisión (ADMIN) -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/en-revision
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Aprobar con notas de resolución (ADMIN) -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/aprobar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "resolutionNotes": "Solicitud aprobada en prueba QA"
}

### Cerrar (ADMIN) -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/cerrar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Historial de transiciones -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ---- Solicitud para probar rechazo ----
# @name createSolicitudRechazo
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "requestTypeId": {{createTipo.response.body.data.id}},
  "title": "Solicitud para rechazar",
  "description": "Esta solicitud se rechazará en la prueba"
}

### Pasar a revisión antes de rechazar (rechazar solo es válido desde in_review) -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitudRechazo.response.body.data.id}}/en-revision
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Rechazar con notas demasiado cortas -> 400 (resolutionNotes min 3)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitudRechazo.response.body.data.id}}/rechazar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "resolutionNotes": "no"
}

### Rechazar con notas -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitudRechazo.response.body.data.id}}/rechazar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "resolutionNotes": "No cumple los requisitos de la prueba"
}

### ============================================
### COMENTARIOS  (request_comments, borrado lógico con deleted_at)
### ============================================

### Crear comentario -> 201
# @name createComentario
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "body": "Comentario de prueba QA",
  "isInternal": false
}

### Nota interna (solo personal) -> 201
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "body": "Nota interna QA",
  "isInternal": true
}

### Listar comentarios -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Eliminar comentario (soft delete) -> 200
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/comentarios/{{createComentario.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### ADJUNTOS  (request_attachments -> storage.files)
### fileId: id devuelto al subir el archivo en storage-service.http
### ============================================

### Adjuntar archivo -> 201
# @name createAdjunto
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/adjuntos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "fileId": {{fileId}}
}

### Listar adjuntos -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/adjuntos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Eliminar adjunto -> 200
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/solicitudes/{{createSolicitud.response.body.data.id}}/adjuntos/{{createAdjunto.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### LIMPIEZA
### Las solicitudes tienen auditoría: no se borran. Solo se eliminan el tipo y la categoría
### de prueba cuando no tienen solicitudes asociadas.
### ============================================
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/tipos/{{createTipo.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/solicitudes/categorias/{{createCategoria.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
